1
00:00:01,421 --> 00:00:03,421
== sync, corrected by elderman ==
@elder_man

2
00:00:05,534 --> 00:00:07,204
(Penny:)Okay, so it's not
a legal ceremony,

3
00:00:07,202 --> 00:00:08,372
(Penny:)it's just a chance for us

4
00:00:08,370 --> 00:00:10,970
(Penny:)to redo our vows
so everyone can be part of it.

5
00:00:10,972 --> 00:00:14,472
So there's no maid of honor?

6
00:00:14,476 --> 00:00:15,406
(Penny:)No.

7
00:00:15,410 --> 00:00:18,580
(Amy:)Huh.

8
00:00:18,580 --> 00:00:21,880
(Amy:)But if I were to, say,
wear a purple satin dress

9
00:00:21,883 --> 00:00:24,213
(Amy:)with a sweetheart neckline
and stand near you,

10
00:00:24,219 --> 00:00:26,649
(Amy:)you wouldn't be able
to stop me, right?

11
00:00:28,190 --> 00:00:29,660
(Penny:)I don't see how I could.

12
00:00:29,658 --> 00:00:30,658
(chuckles)

13
00:00:30,659 --> 00:00:33,489
(Amy:)Then I graciously accept.

14
00:00:33,495 --> 00:00:34,995
(Bernadette:)Who's going to officiate?

15
00:00:34,996 --> 00:00:36,696
(Penny:)I was kind of hoping you would.

16
00:00:36,698 --> 00:00:39,598
(Amy:)Wait, now I'm just some
lousy maid of honor?

17
00:00:41,002 --> 00:00:43,272
(Sheldon:)Hey, good news, I just got off
the phone with my mother.

18
00:00:43,271 --> 00:00:44,341
(Sheldon:)She is coming to the wedding.

19
00:00:44,339 --> 00:00:46,069
(Penny:)Okay, wait,

20
00:00:46,074 --> 00:00:47,844
(Penny:)you're inviting people
to our wedding?

21
00:00:47,843 --> 00:00:51,743
(Sheldon:)Yes, I'm inviting
people to our wedding.

22
00:00:51,747 --> 00:00:53,017
(Sheldon:)Yeah, I've already asked

23
00:00:53,014 --> 00:00:55,384
(Sheldon:)Stephen Hawking
and Robert Downey Jr.

24
00:00:55,384 --> 00:00:56,984
(Sheldon:)And now, don't get your hopes
up, 'cause he's pretty busy,

25
00:00:56,985 --> 00:00:59,355
(Sheldon:)but Erno Rubik.

26
00:00:59,354 --> 00:01:01,354
(Bernadette:)Who's Erno Rubik?

